claim:
    ? forall x,y R:
        0 <= x
        0 <= y
        sqrt(x)+sqrt(y) != 0
        =>:
            sqrt(x)-sqrt(y) = (x-y)/(sqrt(x)+sqrt(y))
    sqrt(x)^2 = x
    sqrt(y)^2 = y
    (sqrt(x)-sqrt(y))*(sqrt(x)+sqrt(y)) = sqrt(x)^2-sqrt(y)^2 = x-y
    sqrt(x)-sqrt(y) = ((sqrt(x)-sqrt(y))*(sqrt(x)+sqrt(y)))/(sqrt(x)+sqrt(y)) = (x-y)/(sqrt(x)+sqrt(y))
